{"Code":200,"Message":"operation success","MoreMessage":"","TipType":"Success","Count":2199,"ReturnUrl":null,"Data":[{"Id":"cec33e26-4b86-447a-b475-fbe6494dd5b9","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":270704338,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"TSE工程师(J18035)","OrgId":3456352,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"工作职责\n1.承担扫地机器人及相关产品测试规划活动；\n2.把控测试过程、及交付质量；\n3.承担系统级的软硬件结合的相关测试设计、规划工作\n4.输出系统级的测试方案，根据质量表现对方案持续修订优化；\n5.承担公司质量规划落地、质量标准执行等工作；\n6.能根据产品定位及用户场景，制定测试策略；\n7.培养应届生以及初级员工，建立知识体系，对初级员工进行专业指导；","Require":"任职资格\n1.负责公司扫地机器人的测试规划工作；\n2.智能硬件产品5年或以上相关经验，有移动机器人产品测试经验优先；\n3.有软件或硬件功能、性能和可靠性等测试设计规划经验；\n4.至少在软件测试、硬件测试、电路板级测试等一个领域有独立设计规划测试能力；\n5.有新员工培养能力，初级员工辅导能力；\n6.有一定平台建设能力，如标准化工作建设，自动化建设；\n7.能在某些领域有不断提升、探索的能力，并转化落地；\n8.本科及以上学历，计算机、电子或机械等相关专业；","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"fdd12280-09b5-4bb3-a58c-a5f01ea57614","Head