制及设计工作，如：产品图纸，零部件图纸，BOM编制等。完成产品文件，如：技术规格书、特殊特性清单、包装、名牌、说明书、成本核算、投资回报率等；\n4、负责现有产品全生命周期维护工作，如：质量改善、降本、效率提升、衍生品等事项；\n5、对制造、品质、采购、供方等模块提供日常技术支持；","Require":"1、全日制大学本科及以上学历，机械相关专业；\n2、有5年以上厨房电器（大电/小电）开发经验，熟悉厨房电器（大电/小电）设计、性能要求、测试标准等。可以独立承担厨房电器（大电/小电）新平台项目开发。独立解决新品开发过程中的技术问题；\n3、熟练运用UG/Proe/Solidworks等任一种开发软件，熟悉塑料件、钣金件成型工艺及模具制作，熟悉GB4706、UL749、IEC60335等家电产品标准，熟悉家电产品开发流程，可以独立承担开发任务；\n4、有责任感和事业心，有较好的创新能力者优先；\n5、具备CFD/CAE仿真能力者优先；","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"f48560bf-1e6c-4a00-a709-c5099713aabc","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":270688356,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"电池包硬件工程师(J18611)","OrgId":0,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1.合作开发项目的方案评审、测试验证、不良分析；\n2.自主开发电池包电子方案设计；\n3.量产电池包的降本维护；","Require":"1.本科以上学历，三年以上工作经验，二年以上锂电池BMS自主开发经验；\n2.完成过2款以上量产锂电池包的硬件开发；\n3.熟悉锂电池特性，熟悉常见SOC算法和策略；","ClassificationOne":null,"C